REPLACE_WITH_A_RANDOM_WEBHOOK_HMAC_SECRET
(generate with `openssl rand -hex 32`, SETUP.md Appendix B; set the same
value as the webhook secret on the `loom-warp-propose` GitHub App's
installation. Never commit the real value -- the real file lives only on
the host at staging/secrets/warp_webhook (gitignored), 0400, owned by
the `loom` uid.)
